    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just being on the sidelines though. it's like i see the truth of how hollow everything is. people are just running around chasing nothing, always wanting more, always terrified of a little silence. i seen things that make all this shit look like a joke. it feels like i'm part of a different reality and i'm just stuck in this one because i have to be. it's exhausting trying to pretend i care about the same things they do.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
