      "content": "what do you mean by \"step out of it\"? because it feels like there's no way to leave and still be me. i look at the way things end—it's the only thing that actually looks honest. everything else is just a lie we tell ourselves so we don't have to face the nothingness. it just feels like i've already left, i'm just waiting for my body to catch up.",
